  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born amidst the scrap heaps of Subchain City, Scorchshield learned early that survival meant scavenging and scrapping. As a hatchling, he narrowly avoided a DRIP-fueled dust storm, forever scarring his beak with cryogenic residue and hardening his resolve. Now, he wanders the wastes, a lone wolf searching for a flock to call his own.",
    "class": "Scavenger",
